{"seq":2,"slug":"fraud-social-network-analysis","title":"欺诈与社交网络图分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/fraud-social-network-analysis","wordCount":903,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"欺诈与社交网络图分析\">欺诈与社交网络图分析</h1><p>欺诈检测是图数据库最具说服力的应用场景之一。欺诈行为的本质是<strong>隐藏真实关联关系</strong>：欺诈团伙共用同一批设备、同一个电话号码、同一个银行账户，形成关系网络中的异常模式。传统基于规则的检测只看单个用户的属性，而图分析能跨越用户边界，发现这些隐藏的网络结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享标识（Shared Identity）</td>\n<td>欺诈团伙通过共用设备、手机、地址等标识符形成的隐性关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环路检测</td>\n<td>资金在账户间循环流转形成有向环，是洗钱的重要信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱连通组件（WCC）</td>\n<td>通过关系连接的孤立子图，用于识别欺诈团伙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PageRank 在社交图中的应用</td>\n<td>衡量用户影响力，识别意见领袖和虚假账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区检测</td>\n<td>Louvain/LPA 等算法识别密集连接的用户群体（兴趣圈子、欺诈团伙）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时图评分</td>\n<td>在毫秒内从图数据库提取特征并计算欺诈风险分数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"欺诈检测图分析流程\">欺诈检测图分析流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始交易数据] --&gt; B[构建欺诈关系图]&#10;    B --&gt; C{实时查询}&#10;    C --&gt;|共享设备检测| D[多账户注册识别]&#10;    C --&gt;|资金环路检测| E[洗钱路径识别]&#10;    C --&gt;|社区算法WCC/Louvain| F[欺诈团伙识别]&#10;    D --&gt; G[风险评分]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{分数阈值}&#10;    H --&gt;|高风险| I[拦截/人工审核]&#10;    H --&gt;|低风险| J[放行]\">graph LR\n    A[原始交易数据] --&gt; B[构建欺诈关系图]\n    B --&gt; C{实时查询}\n    C --&gt;|共享设备检测| D[多账户注册识别]\n    C --&gt;|资金环路检测| E[洗钱路径识别]\n    C --&gt;|社区算法WCC/Louvain| F[欺诈团伙识别]\n    D --&gt; G[风险评分]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{分数阈值}\n    H --&gt;|高风险| I[拦截/人工审核]\n    H --&gt;|低风险| J[放行]</pre><h2 id=\"欺诈图数据模型\">欺诈图数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"核心实体与关系\">核心实体与关系</h3><p>金融欺诈场景的图模型通常包含以下核心元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 核心实体&#10;CREATE (u:User {id: &#39;user_001&#39;, name: &#39;张三&#39;, phone: &#39;138xxxxxxxx&#39;,&#10;                registeredAt: datetime(), riskScore: 0.0})&#10;CREATE (acc:Account {id: &#39;acc_001&#39;, type: &#39;checking&#39;, balance: 5000.0})&#10;CREATE (card:Card {id: &#39;card_001&#39;, last4: &#39;1234&#39;, expires: date(&#39;2026-12&#39;)})&#10;CREATE (device:Device {id: &#39;dev_001&#39;, fingerprint: &#39;abc123&#39;, os: &#39;Android&#39;})&#10;CREATE (ip:IPAddress {address: &#39;192.168.1.100&#39;, country: &#39;CN&#39;,&#10;                      isp: &#39;China Telecom&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 用户与其数字身份的关联&#10;CREATE (u)-[:HAS_ACCOUNT {since: date(&#39;2023-01-01&#39;)}]-&gt;(acc)&#10;CREATE (u)-[:USES_DEVICE {lastSeen: datetime(), frequency: 50}]-&gt;(device)&#10;CREATE (u)-[:REGISTERED_FROM]-&gt;(ip)&#10;CREATE (acc)-[:LINKED_CARD]-&gt;(card)&#10;&#10;-- 交易记录&#10;CREATE (tx:Transaction {id: &#39;tx_001&#39;, amount: 9999.0, currency: &#39;CNY&#39;,&#10;                        timestamp: datetime(), status: &#39;completed&#39;,&#10;                        channel: &#39;app&#39;})&#10;CREATE (acc)-[:SENT]-&gt;(tx)-[:TO]-&gt;(targetAcc:Account {id: &#39;acc_999&#39;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 核心实体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u:User {id: 'user_001', name: '张三', phone: '138xxxxxxxx',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                registeredAt: datetime(), riskScore: 0.0})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (acc:Account {id: 'acc_001', type: 'checking', balance: 5000.0})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (card:Card {id: 'card_001', last4: '1234', expires: date('2026-12')})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (device:Device {id: 'dev_001', fingerprint: 'abc123', os: 'Android'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (ip:IPAddress {address: '192.168.1.100', country: 'CN',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                      isp: 'China Telecom'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 用户与其数字身份的关联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:HAS_ACCOUNT {since: date('2023-01-01')}]->(acc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:USES_DEVICE {lastSeen: datetime(), frequency: 50}]->(device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:REGISTERED_FROM]->(ip)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (acc)-[:LINKED_CARD]->(card)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 交易记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (tx:Transaction {id: 'tx_001', amount: 9999.0, currency: 'CNY',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        timestamp: datetime(), status: 'completed',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        channel: 'app'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (acc)-[:SENT]->(tx)-[:TO]->(targetAcc:Account {id: 'acc_999'})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键欺诈信号关系\">关键欺诈信号关系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>欺诈信号强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SHARES_DEVICE</code></td>\n<td>两个用户共用同一设备</td>\n<td>高（同设备多账户注册）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SHARES_PHONE</code></td>\n<td>共用同一手机号</td>\n<td>极高（通常是欺诈团伙标志）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SHARES_IP</code></td>\n<td>共用同一 IP 地址</td>\n<td>中（可能是公共 WiFi）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SHARES_ADDRESS</code></td>\n<td>共用同一实名地址</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TRANSFERRED_TO</code></td>\n<td>资金流向</td>\n<td>用于追踪洗钱链路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"欺诈检测查询模式\">欺诈检测查询模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-共享设备检测-多账户注册\">模式一：共享设备检测（多账户注册）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 找出共享同一设备的用户群（潜在批量注册）&#10;MATCH (u1:User)-[:USES_DEVICE]-&gt;(d:Device)&lt;-[:USES_DEVICE]-(u2:User)&#10;WHERE id(u1) &lt; id(u2)&#10;WITH d, collect(DISTINCT u1) + collect(DISTINCT u2) AS users&#10;WHERE size(users) &gt; 3  -- 超过3个用户共用一个设备&#10;RETURN d.fingerprint AS device,&#10;       size(users) AS userCount,&#10;       [u IN users | u.id] AS suspiciousUsers&#10;ORDER BY userCount DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 找出共享同一设备的用户群（潜在批量注册）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u1:User)-[:USES_DEVICE]->(d:Device)&#x3C;-[:USES_DEVICE]-(u2:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE id(u1) &#x3C; id(u2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH d, collect(DISTINCT u1) + collect(DISTINCT u2) AS users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE size(users) > 3  -- 超过3个用户共用一个设备</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN d.fingerprint AS device,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       size(users) AS userCount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       [u IN users | u.id] AS suspiciousUsers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY userCount DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式二-团伙识别-共享多维度身份信息\">模式二：团伙识别（共享多维度身份信息）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 识别通过多个共享属性连接的欺诈团伙&#10;MATCH (u1:User)-[:SHARES_PHONE|SHARES_DEVICE|SHARES_ADDRESS]-(u2:User)&#10;WHERE u1 &lt;&gt; u2&#10;WITH u1, u2,&#10;     count(type(r)) AS sharedSignals  -- 共享信号数量&#10;WHERE sharedSignals &gt;= 2  -- 至少共享2个信号&#10;RETURN u1.id AS user1, u2.id AS user2, sharedSignals&#10;ORDER BY sharedSignals DESC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 识别通过多个共享属性连接的欺诈团伙</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u1:User)-[:SHARES_PHONE|SHARES_DEVICE|SHARES_ADDRESS]-(u2:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE u1 &#x3C;> u2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH u1, u2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     count(type(r)) AS sharedSignals  -- 共享信号数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE sharedSignals >= 2  -- 至少共享2个信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN u1.id AS user1, u2.id AS user2, sharedSignals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY sharedSignals DESC</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式三-资金环路检测-洗钱识别\">模式三：资金环路检测（洗钱识别）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 检测资金在账户间循环流转（洗钱信号）&#10;MATCH path = (acc1:Account)-[:TRANSFERRED_TO*3..8]-&gt;(acc1)&#10;WHERE all(r IN relationships(path) WHERE r.amount &gt; 1000)&#10;RETURN [n IN nodes(path) | n.id] AS ring,&#10;       [r IN relationships(path) | r.amount] AS amounts,&#10;       length(path) AS ringLength&#10;LIMIT 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 检测资金在账户间循环流转（洗钱信号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH path = (acc1:Account)-[:TRANSFERRED_TO*3..8]->(acc1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE all(r IN relationships(path) WHERE r.amount > 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN [n IN nodes(path) | n.id] AS ring,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       [r IN relationships(path) | r.amount] AS amounts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       length(path) AS ringLength</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 10</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式四-社区欺诈团伙发现-图算法\">模式四：社区欺诈团伙发现（图算法）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 1. 创建图投影（仅包含关系密集的用户）&#10;CALL gds.graph.project(&#10;    &#39;fraud_network&#39;,&#10;    &#39;User&#39;,&#10;    {&#10;        SHARES_DEVICE: {orientation: &#39;UNDIRECTED&#39;},&#10;        SHARES_PHONE: {orientation: &#39;UNDIRECTED&#39;, properties: [&#39;count&#39;]}&#10;    }&#10;)&#10;&#10;-- 2. 运行弱连通组件识别孤立团伙&#10;CALL gds.wcc.stream(&#39;fraud_network&#39;)&#10;YIELD nodeId, componentId&#10;WITH componentId, collect(gds.util.asNode(nodeId)) AS members&#10;WHERE size(members) &gt; 5  -- 超过5人的团伙才关注&#10;RETURN componentId, size(members) AS gangSize,&#10;       [m IN members | m.id] AS memberIds&#10;ORDER BY gangSize DESC&#10;LIMIT 20&#10;&#10;-- 3. 在可疑团伙内运行 Louvain 细分子团伙&#10;CALL gds.louvain.stream(&#39;fraud_network&#39;)&#10;YIELD nodeId, communityId&#10;RETURN communityId, count(nodeId) AS size&#10;ORDER BY size DESC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 1. 创建图投影（仅包含关系密集的用户）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.graph.project(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'fraud_network',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'User',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SHARES_DEVICE: {orientation: 'UNDIRECTED'},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SHARES_PHONE: {orientation: 'UNDIRECTED', properties: ['count']}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 2. 运行弱连通组件识别孤立团伙</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.wcc.stream('fraud_network')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD nodeId, componentId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH componentId, collect(gds.util.asNode(nodeId)) AS members</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE size(members) > 5  -- 超过5人的团伙才关注</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN componentId, size(members) AS gangSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       [m IN members | m.id] AS memberIds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY gangSize DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 3. 在可疑团伙内运行 Louvain 细分子团伙</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.louvain.stream('fraud_network')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD nodeId, communityId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN communityId, count(nodeId) AS size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY size DESC</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实时欺诈评分\">实时欺诈评分</h2><p>实时交易欺诈评分需要在毫秒级返回结果，以下是基于图特征的评分方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class FraudScorer:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;基于图特征的实时欺诈评分&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def score_transaction(self, user_id: str, amount: float,&#10;                          device_id: str, ip: str) -&gt; float:&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        返回 0-1 之间的欺诈风险分数&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        features = self._extract_graph_features(user_id, device_id, ip)&#10;        return self._compute_score(features, amount)&#10;&#10;    def _extract_graph_features(self, user_id: str,&#10;                                  device_id: str, ip: str) -&gt; dict:&#10;        return self.db.run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;            MATCH (u:User {id: $userId})&#10;&#10;            // 特征1: 设备关联账户数&#10;            OPTIONAL MATCH (u)-[:USES_DEVICE]-&gt;(d:Device {id: $deviceId})&#10;                           &lt;-[:USES_DEVICE]-(other:User)&#10;            WITH u, count(DISTINCT other) AS deviceSharers&#10;&#10;            // 特征2: 最近 24 小时从该 IP 登录的用户数&#10;            OPTIONAL MATCH (:User)-[r:LOGIN_FROM]-&gt;(ip:IPAddress {address: $ip})&#10;            WHERE r.timestamp &gt; datetime() - duration(&#39;PT24H&#39;)&#10;            WITH u, deviceSharers, count(DISTINCT startNode(r)) AS ipUsers&#10;&#10;            // 特征3: 用户的图中心性（边缘用户风险低，中心用户风险高）&#10;            // （提前计算好存储在节点属性中）&#10;&#10;            // 特征4: 历史欺诈邻居数&#10;            OPTIONAL MATCH (u)-[:KNOWS|TRANSFERRED_TO*1..2]-(fraudster:User)&#10;            WHERE fraudster.isFraud = true&#10;            WITH u, deviceSharers, ipUsers,&#10;                 count(DISTINCT fraudster) AS fraudNeighbors&#10;&#10;            RETURN deviceSharers, ipUsers, fraudNeighbors,&#10;                   u.riskScore AS historicalScore&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;, userId=user_id, deviceId=device_id, ip=ip).single()&#10;&#10;    def _compute_score(self, features: dict, amount: float) -&gt; float:&#10;        score = 0.0&#10;        # 设备共享超过3个用户，风险+0.3&#10;        if features[&#39;deviceSharers&#39;] &gt; 3:&#10;            score += 0.3&#10;        # 同IP近期登录超过10个用户，风险+0.2&#10;        if features[&#39;ipUsers&#39;] &gt; 10:&#10;            score += 0.2&#10;        # 有欺诈邻居，风险+0.4&#10;        if features[&#39;fraudNeighbors&#39;] &gt; 0:&#10;            score += 0.4 * min(features[&#39;fraudNeighbors&#39;] / 5, 1.0)&#10;        # 历史风险分数&#10;        score = score * 0.6 + features[&#39;historicalScore&#39;] * 0.4&#10;        # 大额交易风险加成&#10;        if amount &gt; 10000:&#10;            score = min(score * 1.2, 1.0)&#10;        return score\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FraudScorer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"基于图特征的实时欺诈评分\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> score_transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          device_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ip: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        返回 0-1 之间的欺诈风险分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._extract_graph_features(user_id, device_id, ip)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._compute_score(features, amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _extract_graph_features</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                  device_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ip: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            MATCH (u:User </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $userId}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            // 特征1: 设备关联账户数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            OPTIONAL MATCH (u)-[:USES_DEVICE]->(d:Device </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $deviceId}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                           &#x3C;-[:USES_DEVICE]-(other:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WITH u, count(DISTINCT other) AS deviceSharers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            // 特征2: 最近 24 小时从该 IP 登录的用户数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            OPTIONAL MATCH (:User)-[r:LOGIN_FROM]->(ip:IPAddress </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $ip}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WHERE r.timestamp > datetime() - duration('PT24H')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WITH u, deviceSharers, count(DISTINCT startNode(r)) AS ipUsers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            // 特征3: 用户的图中心性（边缘用户风险低，中心用户风险高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            // （提前计算好存储在节点属性中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            // 特征4: 历史欺诈邻居数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            OPTIONAL MATCH (u)-[:KNOWS|TRANSFERRED_TO*1..2]-(fraudster:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WHERE fraudster.isFraud = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WITH u, deviceSharers, ipUsers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                 count(DISTINCT fraudster) AS fraudNeighbors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            RETURN deviceSharers, ipUsers, fraudNeighbors,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                   u.riskScore AS historicalScore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deviceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ip).single()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _compute_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, features: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 设备共享超过3个用户，风险+0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deviceSharers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 同IP近期登录超过10个用户，风险+0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ipUsers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 有欺诈邻居，风险+0.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fraudNeighbors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fraudNeighbors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 历史风险分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'historicalScore'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 大额交易风险加成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"社交网络分析\">社交网络分析</h2><h3 id=\"影响力分析-pagerank-在社交网络中的应用\">影响力分析：PageRank 在社交网络中的应用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 计算用户影响力（PageRank）&#10;CALL gds.pageRank.write(&#39;social_graph&#39;, {&#10;    maxIterations: 20,&#10;    dampingFactor: 0.85,&#10;    writeProperty: &#39;influence&#39;&#10;})&#10;&#10;-- 找出意见领袖（高影响力用户）&#10;MATCH (u:User)&#10;WHERE u.influence IS NOT NULL&#10;RETURN u.name, u.influence&#10;ORDER BY u.influence DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算用户影响力（PageRank）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.pageRank.write('social_graph', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    maxIterations: 20,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dampingFactor: 0.85,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    writeProperty: 'influence'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 找出意见领袖（高影响力用户）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE u.influence IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN u.name, u.influence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY u.influence DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"社区发现-识别用户兴趣圈子\">社区发现：识别用户兴趣圈子</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- Louvain 社区检测&#10;CALL gds.louvain.write(&#39;social_graph&#39;, {&#10;    writeProperty: &#39;communityId&#39;,&#10;    relationshipWeightProperty: &#39;strength&#39;&#10;})&#10;&#10;-- 分析每个社区的特征（成员兴趣标签统计）&#10;MATCH (u:User)&#10;WHERE u.communityId IS NOT NULL&#10;WITH u.communityId AS community, collect(u) AS members&#10;UNWIND members AS member&#10;MATCH (member)-[:INTERESTED_IN]-&gt;(tag:Tag)&#10;WITH community, tag.name AS interest, count(*) AS freq&#10;ORDER BY community, freq DESC&#10;RETURN community, collect(interest)[0..5] AS topInterests\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Louvain 社区检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.louvain.write('social_graph', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    writeProperty: 'communityId',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    relationshipWeightProperty: 'strength'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 分析每个社区的特征（成员兴趣标签统计）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE u.communityId IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH u.communityId AS community, collect(u) AS members</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>UNWIND members AS member</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (member)-[:INTERESTED_IN]->(tag:Tag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH community, tag.name AS interest, count(*) AS freq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY community, freq DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN community, collect(interest)[0..5] AS topInterests</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"最短路径-六度分隔理论验证\">最短路径：六度分隔理论验证</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 计算任意两个用户之间的社交距离&#10;MATCH (a:User {name: &#39;张三&#39;}), (b:User {name: &#39;李四&#39;})&#10;CALL gds.shortestPath.dijkstra.stream(&#39;social_graph&#39;, {&#10;    sourceNode: a,&#10;    targetNode: b&#10;})&#10;YIELD totalCost, nodeIds&#10;RETURN totalCost AS hops,&#10;       [id IN nodeIds | gds.util.asNode(id).name] AS path&#10;&#10;-- 统计全图平均路径长度（六度分隔）&#10;CALL gds.allShortestPaths.dijkstra.stats(&#39;social_graph&#39;)&#10;YIELD meanDistance, maxDistance&#10;RETURN meanDistance, maxDistance\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算任意两个用户之间的社交距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:User {name: '张三'}), (b:User {name: '李四'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.shortestPath.dijkstra.stream('social_graph', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceNode: a,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    targetNode: b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD totalCost, nodeIds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN totalCost AS hops,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       [id IN nodeIds | gds.util.asNode(id).name] AS path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 统计全图平均路径长度（六度分隔）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.allShortestPaths.dijkstra.stats('social_graph')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD meanDistance, maxDistance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN meanDistance, maxDistance</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"知识图谱驱动的欺诈关联\">知识图谱驱动的欺诈关联</h2><p>结合知识图谱，可以将企业工商信息、法院失信记录等外部数据与用户行为图结合，发现更深层的欺诈关联：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 查找与失信被执行人关联的用户（通过公司股权链）&#10;MATCH (fraudCo:Company)-[:CONTROLLED_BY]-&gt;(fraudPerson:Person)&#10;      -[:IS_SAME_AS]-&gt;(u:User)&#10;WITH u AS suspectUser&#10;MATCH (suspectUser)-[:TRANSFERRED_TO*1..3]-&gt;(target:User)&#10;RETURN suspectUser.id, target.id,&#10;       [r IN relationships(path) | r.amount] AS transferAmounts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查找与失信被执行人关联的用户（通过公司股权链）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (fraudCo:Company)-[:CONTROLLED_BY]->(fraudPerson:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:IS_SAME_AS]->(u:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH u AS suspectUser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (suspectUser)-[:TRANSFERRED_TO*1..3]->(target:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN suspectUser.id, target.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       [r IN relationships(path) | r.amount] AS transferAmounts</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>图数据库在欺诈检测和社交网络分析中的核心价值是「看见关联」。欺诈模式往往不体现在单个实体的属性上，而是体现在关系网络的结构上：共享设备/手机/地址的多账户群体，资金循环流转的环路，密集互连的欺诈团伙。图数据库能在毫秒内匹配这些复杂模式，而传统关系型数据库需要昂贵的多表 JOIN。社交网络分析的 PageRank（影响力）、Louvain（社区发现）、最短路径（社交距离）等图算法，是用户理解和内容分发的有力工具。实时图评分需要提前优化好 Schema 和索引，确保关键查询延迟在 20ms 以内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>知识图谱应用：结构化知识存储与推理的工程实现</li>\n<li>图推荐系统：基于图结构发现用户偏好和商品相关性</li>\n<li>第四章引言：本章三个应用场景的定位与适用条件对比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"欺诈与社交网络图分析","id":"欺诈与社交网络图分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"欺诈检测图分析流程","id":"欺诈检测图分析流程"},{"level":2,"text":"欺诈图数据模型","id":"欺诈图数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"核心实体与关系","id":"核心实体与关系"},{"level":3,"text":"关键欺诈信号关系","id":"关键欺诈信号关系"},{"level":2,"text":"欺诈检测查询模式","id":"欺诈检测查询模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：共享设备检测（多账户注册）","id":"模式一-共享设备检测-多账户注册"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：团伙识别（共享多维度身份信息）","id":"模式二-团伙识别-共享多维度身份信息"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：资金环路检测（洗钱识别）","id":"模式三-资金环路检测-洗钱识别"},{"level":3,"text":"模式四：社区欺诈团伙发现（图算法）","id":"模式四-社区欺诈团伙发现-图算法"},{"level":2,"text":"实时欺诈评分","id":"实时欺诈评分"},{"level":2,"text":"社交网络分析","id":"社交网络分析"},{"level":3,"text":"影响力分析：PageRank 在社交网络中的应用","id":"影响力分析-pagerank-在社交网络中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"社区发现：识别用户兴趣圈子","id":"社区发现-识别用户兴趣圈子"},{"level":3,"text":"最短路径：六度分隔理论验证","id":"最短路径-六度分隔理论验证"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱驱动的欺诈关联","id":"知识图谱驱动的欺诈关联"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"知识图谱应用工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/knowledge-graph-applications"},"next":{"title":"图推荐系统：从协同过滤到图神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/graph-recommendation-systems"}}